sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant LogoutView as LogoutView (Django)
    participant Session as Session Store

    User->>Browser: Click "Logout"
    Browser->>LogoutView: POST /accounts/logout/
    LogoutView->>Session: flush() session data
    Session-->>Browser: clear sessionid cookie
    LogoutView-->>Browser: redirect to /
    Browser-->>User: show landing page (logged out)
